@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
title Repository Issue / Board Interaction
start
:Enter authorized ProjectForge context;
:Select permitted repository and issue;
:Choose edit or board move using pointer or keyboard;
:Submit intended change with expected version and request identity;
:Validate caller, current entitlement and local action grant;
if (Authority established and permitted?) then (yes)
 if (Version and request identity consistent?) then (yes)
  :Record owning operation / resolve matching prior result;
  :Show stable issue identity, new state and confirmed outcome;
 else (no)
  :Show conflict without overwriting newer work;
  :Review current issue before another edit;
 endif
else (no / unavailable)
 :Show safe denied or unavailable state;
endif
:Native Git uses its separate transport credentials and grant;
stop
@enduml
